  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 8, 'Proof of Vaccination scenario': verification of a claim of vaccination. Four lanes: DDCC holder, verifier, national PHA, international PHA. (1) The holder presents the DDCC:VS; (2) the verifier receives the claim. Is cryptographic verification required? No leads straight to Point C, the decision on the verification. Yes: (3) the verifier uses a status checking application; perform check online? No leads to Point C. Yes: (4) the national PHA performs an online check with its DDCC registry service; check with international PHA? If yes, (5) the international PHA performs an online check with its registry service; either way (6) results are communicated back to the verifier, then Point C and End.",
